  "text": "## Plan your Siargao trip\n\nSurf breaks, island hopping and lagoons. Ask anything, or start with one of these:\n\n- First trip, 4 days\n- Flights under 8,000\n- Surf this week\n- Stays near Cloud 9\n- Flexible dates\n\n**Featured spots**\n- **Sugba Lagoon** (Del Carmen): Turquoise lagoon in the mangroves. Paddle board, swim, jump.\n- **Guyam Island** (Island hopping): A tiny palm island 15 minutes by boat from General Luna.\n- **Magpupungko rock pools** (Pilar): Natural pools that appear at low tide on the east coast.\n\n**Best time to go:** March to October is the drier stretch. November to February brings more rain and rougher boat rides, so keep a spare day in your plan.",
